NAME
    mount - mount the drive-1 card

SYNOPSIS
    mount

DESCRIPTION
    Mounts the second CompactFlash card at /d1 after it has been
    inserted. Used together with umount to hot-swap the drive-1 card:
    umount, swap the card, then mount. mount is an OS built-in command.

EXAMPLES
    mount
    cd /d1

SEE ALSO
    umount, cd, format
